{
  "uid": "seonjalal-v3-payment-rabbitmq",
  "title": "Seonjalal V3 / Payment RabbitMQ",
  "description": "BE 결제 MQ 대시보드의 V3 운영 수집 범위 적용본. 결제 큐 지표 부재는 정상 0건과 다름. 원본 BE 5a32a6aa.",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 0,
  "editable": true,
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "15s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "tags": [
    "gift",
    "monitoring",
    "rabbitmq",
    "payment"
  ],
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "지표를 읽기 전에",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**범위: seonjalal-v3 / production / gift.** 결제 작업 큐 5개·DLQ 5개를 대상으로 합니다.\n\n**No data ≠ 메시지 0건.** 큐 미생성·지표 부재·수집 장애를 확인하세요. 결제 지표를 강제로 0으로 채우지 않습니다. 빈 DLQ의 head timestamp 0도 나이 계산에서 제외합니다.\n\n하단의 기존 신고·프로파일링 큐는 수집 연결 확인용입니다. Consumer 수·Confirm·경고 미발화만으로 결제 업무 성공을 판정하지 않습니다. 수집 상태는 Explore에서 `up{cluster=\"seonjalal-v3\",environment=\"production\"}`로 확인하세요."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "DLQ depth",
      "description": "Total messages in the five payment DLQs; non-zero messages need operator review.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "seonjalal-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max by (queue) (rabbitmq_detailed_queue_messages{cluster=\"seonjalal-v3\",environment=\"production\",job=\"rabbitmq-queues\",vhost=\"gift\",queue=~\"^gift[.](receipt[.]email|roulette|coupon[.]restore|payment[.](approval|cancellation)[.]recovery)[.]dlq$\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{queue}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "seonjalal-prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Work queue backlog",
      "description": "Ready messages await delivery; unacked messages are in flight or awaiting acknowledgement.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "seonjalal-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max by (queue) (rabbitmq_detailed_queue_messages_ready{cluster=\"seonjalal-v3\",environment=\"production\",job=\"rabbitmq-queues\",vhost=\"gift\",queue=~\"^gift[.](receipt[.]email|roulette|coupon[.]restore|payment[.](approval|cancellation)[.]recovery)[.]q$\"})",
          "legendFormat": "ready · {{queue}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "seonjalal-prometheus"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "max by (queue) (rabbitmq_detailed_queue_messages_unacked{cluster=\"seonjalal-v3\",environment=\"production\",job=\"rabbitmq-queues\",vhost=\"gift\",queue=~\"^gift[.](receipt[.]email|roulette|coupon[.]restore|payment[.](approval|cancellation)[.]recovery)[.]q$\"})",
          "legendFormat": "unacked · {{queue}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "seonjalal-prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Work queue consumers",
      "description": "Zero consumers can indicate a missing worker; compare with feature flags and rollout state.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "seonjalal-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max by (queue) (rabbitmq_detailed_queue_consumers{cluster=\"seonjalal-v3\",environment=\"production\",job=\"rabbitmq-queues\",vhost=\"gift\",queue=~\"^gift[.](receipt[.]email|roulette|coupon[.]restore|payment[.](approval|cancellation)[.]recovery)[.]q$\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{queue}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "seonjalal-prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
